{"about_the_game":"Your sister Margaret wrote you about a strange invention. When you arrive to visit her, she's vanished! What's left behind are the traces of a bizarre event: Margaret's soul has been broken into fragments and placed in different worlds, where they\u2019ll be used as part of a mysterious device. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt's up to you to save not just Margaret's soul \u2013 but the fate of each world in turn as you navigate the labyrinths and plot twists in this exciting hidden-object puzzle adventure game! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a special Collector's Edition release full of exclusive extras you won\u2019t find in the standard version. The Collector\u2019s Edition includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBattle the evil scientist in the bonus game<br />\r\nDress up your guide character in the dressing room<br />\r\nRe-play hidden scenes and mini-games<br />\r\nSoundtracks, wallpapers, and concept art<br />\r\nAn available strategy guide","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"47cbee811b968d12d2354b28602fbb615b883a26.jpg","localized_name":"Piece Of \u0421ake","name":"Piece Of \u0421ake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/551150/47cbee811b968d12d2354b28602fbb615b883a26.jpg"},{"icon":"58ef3ae85f99694ce26cb787bb40612ee87198d7.jpg","localized_name":"Elementary","name":"Elementary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/551150/58ef3ae85f99694ce26cb787bb40612ee87198d7.jpg"},{"icon":"f9e7909d8b6f3e28b2efc69a2d4832e28eff9754.jpg","localized_name":"Eagle Eye","name":"Eagle Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/551150/f9e7909d8b6f3e28b2efc69a2d4832e28eff9754.jpg"},{"icon":"5fac6a0ac9edf87ff939ec665deb46dd49fd0e44.jpg","localized_name":"Detective","name":"Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/551150/5fac6a0ac9edf87ff939ec665deb46dd49fd0e44.jpg"},{"icon":"4ed1036b52994ac57d3322396b409cc60698f7a4.jpg",